{
  "dataset_version": "v1-requests",
  "note": "Requests in the shape the practice actually receives them: WhatsApp lines and threads, voice notes, screenshots, emails with partial or wrong attachments, feasibility asks, call notes, repeat-client and revised requests, mixed-language and cross-entity asks, and three full packs reissued from v0-synthetic. Fictional. Each field is [status, value, hint]: status is found, ambiguous, missing or referenced (taken from a named past project; found or estimated are both right). The value is the correct one even when the request states it badly.",
